        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Glynn Johnson 450 Series Medium-Duty Surface Overhead Holder / Stop</b>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>The Glynn Johnson 450 series </b>holders and stops are designed for medium to light-duty applications. They're ideal for openings that are subject to normal activity, providing protection for the door, frame, hinges and surrounding walls or obstructions. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Hold Open </b><br>\r\nHolds door open at a predetermined position, permitting onobstructed traffic flow. Adjustable automatic hold-open that is activated when the door is opened to a preset angle. Grade-1 classification. Allen wrench adjustable. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Friction Hold-Open</b><br>\r\nFriction hold-open models provide an alternative holding method, ideal for heavy patient room doors, closet doors or similar applications where multiple hold-open positions are desired. Allen wrench adjustable.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Stop Only</b><br>\r\nIf the hold-open function is not required, the stop-only function provides the same effective door control minus the hold-open feature. May be used on fire doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=..https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/gly-450-series-2.jpg?v=1704354676>\r\n</p>",
