                "description": "Glynn Johnson 450 Series Medium-Duty Surface Overhead Holder/Stop are designed for medium to light-duty applications. They're ideal for openings that are subject to normal activity, providing protection for the door, frame, hinges and surrounding walls or obstructions. ",
